  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-ALKA-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When we become Chronomancers, we swear allegiance to the Order alone, abandoning our Houses, but Duke Dairyus demanded I do otherwise.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381186,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-ALKA-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "For years, he's had me attempting to resurrect Xerxes, hoping the Overlord would help House Purrzian regain its ancient prominence.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381186,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-ALKA-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I don't know what was different this time, but during the sand storm, the magic finally worked. As you heard, however, Xerxes has his own plans.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381186,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-ALKA-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Indeed, the Overlord would re-establish his ancient dominion. He plans to lead his Durvish armies to reconquer all Mirage. No one is safe.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381186,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-ALKA-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I must return to the Chronoverge and atone for my transgressions. If the Dromel nomads remain at Caravan, you must warn them of Xerxes' plan.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_09.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381186,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-ALKA-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Perhaps our paths will cross again in better times. I hope my mistakes don't prevent such a thing. May the Sands save us. May the Sands save us all.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_10.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381186,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
